data: {"answer": "這裡是「酒吧近看」房間，主要展示條碼掃描器與 ERP 庫存畫面。系統包含條碼掃描器、ERP 庫存與採購功能，並提供日誌與監控（SIEM）等防護措施。需注意內部人員濫用與舞弊的威脅，且調整庫存需另一人核准並留下紀錄。", "go": [], "followups": [{"text": "條碼掃描器是做什麼的？", "en": "What does the Barcode Scanner do?", "zh": "條碼掃描器是做什麼的？"}, {"text": "內部人員濫用與舞弊要怎麼防？", "en": "How do we prevent insider misuse & fraud?", "zh": "內部人員濫用與舞弊要怎麼防？"}, {"text": "接下來要去哪？", "en": "What should I do next?", "zh": "接下來要去哪？"}], "trace": {"session": "offline", "lang": "zh", "model": "qwen3.5:9b", "timings": {"route_s": 0.0, "tool_s": 0.01, "answer_s": 7.32, "total_s": 7.33}, "route": {"tool": "room_overview", "target": "", "how": "button"}, "link": {"query": "(current room)", "chosen": "bar_near", "how": "current room"}, "redirect": "", "queries": [{"purpose": "everything placed in this room", "cypher": "MATCH (r:Room {key:$k}) RETURN r {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh} AS r, [(r)-[:IN_AREA]->(a) | a {.key, .name_en, .name_zh}][0] AS area, [(r)-[:CLOSEUP_OF]->(p) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh}][0] AS parent, [(s:System)-[:LOCATED_IN]->(r) | s {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS systems, [(t:Threat)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | t {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS threats, [(c:Control)-[:SEEN_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .type}] AS controls, [(c:Concept)-[:TAUGHT_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS concepts, [(p:Procedure)-[:PRACTISED_IN]->(r) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .kind}] AS procedures, [(d:Department)-[:BASED_IN]->(r) | d {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .ext}] AS departments, [(cs:CaseStudy)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | cs {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .year}] AS cases, [(r)-[l:LINKS_TO]->(x) | x {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh, teleport: l.teleport}] AS exits, size([(f:Finding)-[:IN_ROOM]->(r) | f]) AS findings_here", "params": {"k": "bar_near"}, "rows": 1, "ms": 6.4}], "graph": {"nodes": [{"key": "bar_near", "label": "Room", "en": "Bar · Up Close", "zh": "酒吧近看"}, {"key": "barcode_scanner", "label": "System", "en": "Barcode Scanner", "zh": "條碼掃描器"}, {"key": "erp", "label": "System", "en": "ERP · Inventory & Purchasing", "zh": "ERP 庫存與採購"}, {"key": "insider_fraud", "label": "Threat", "en": "Insider Misuse & Fraud", "zh": "內部人員濫用與舞弊"}, {"key": "logging_monitoring", "label": "Control", "en": "Logging & Monitoring (SIEM)", "zh": "日誌與監控（SIEM）"}, {"key": "sod", "label": "Control", "en": "Segregation of Duties", "zh": "職務分離"}, {"key": "c_anomaly_detection", "label": "Concept", "en": "Anomaly Detection", "zh": "異常偵測"}, {"key": "c_audit_trail", "label": "Concept", "en": "Audit Trail", "zh": "稽核軌跡"}, {"key": "c_erp", "label": "Concept", "en": "Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP)", "zh": "企業資源規劃（ERP）"}], "edges": [{"a": "erp", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "bar_near"}, {"a": "barcode_scanner", "t": "SENDS_TO", "b": "erp"}, {"a": "barcode_scanner", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "bar_near"}, {"a": "insider_fraud", "t": "TARGETS", "b": "erp"}, {"a": "insider_fraud", "t": "SHOWN_IN", "b": "bar_near"}, {"a": "c_erp", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "bar_near"}, {"a": "c_erp", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "erp"}, {"a": "c_anomaly_detection", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "bar_near"}, {"a": "c_anomaly_detection", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "logging_monitoring"}, {"a": "c_audit_trail", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "bar_near"}, {"a": "c_audit_trail", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "logging_monitoring"}, {"a": "sod", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "bar_near"}, {"a": "sod", "t": "PROTECTS", "b": "erp"}, {"a": "sod", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "insider_fraud"}, {"a": "logging_monitoring", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "bar_near"}, {"a": "logging_monitoring", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "insider_fraud"}]}, "tool_used": "room_overview", "facts": "房間：酒吧近看・掃描器與庫存畫面\n代表的資訊主題：條碼掃描器和 ERP 的庫存畫面。\n重點：調整庫存要另一個人核准，而且留下紀錄。\n這裡的系統：條碼掃描器、ERP 庫存與採購\n這裡要注意的威脅：內部人員濫用與舞弊\n看得到的防護措施：日誌與監控（SIEM）、職務分離\n課程概念：異常偵測、稽核軌跡、企業資源規劃（ERP）\n這個房間藏著 1 個資安漏洞（要玩家自己找，不要說出來）\n可以走到：酒吧庫存與 ERP", "answer_stats": {"model": "qwen3.5:9b", "wall_s": 7.32, "load_s": 0.0, "prompt_tokens": 584, "prompt_s": 2.63, "gen_tokens": 72, "gen_s": 4.67, "tok_per_s": 15.4, "first_token_s": 2.65}}, "state": {}}

